title: NeveFirst
---
Neve: Shapers in the lanes. I thought those were expensive warning lights. #emotion:Amused
Taren: Only if we hit something. #emotion:Neutral
Neve: The Choir has closed the Gullet's chambers. Kill the singers and the membranes loosen. Do not lean on the walls. #emotion:Worried
Neve: I left a cache in the second chamber. Copper beacon, cracked casing. Tell it I sent you. #emotion:Determined
<<setFlag neve.cache>>
===
title: NeveRepeat
---
Neve: The cache is yours. My advice costs more: brake before you turn. #emotion:Smug
===
title: NevePost
---
Neve: That key is humming. Either it works or it is very pleased with itself. #emotion:Curious
Neve: The old survey runs into walls. Make sure Sela's chart agrees before you follow the beacon. Tallow is still answering. #emotion:Determined
===
title: OdaFirst
---
Oda: Mind the paint. Everything we own is in this hauler, and most of it is strapped to the outside. #emotion:Amused
Oda: We filed for the Nacre transfer. One harbour, one berth, one departure every cycle. Nobody is left behind if everyone leaves together. #emotion:Neutral
Taren: And if the berth has a bad day? #emotion:Neutral
Oda: Then it is a very bad day for a lot of people at once. My mother says I am morbid. #emotion:Worried
===
title: OdaRepeat
---
Oda: Next transfer window, we go. Everyone at Nacre goes. That is rather the point. #emotion:Neutral
===
title: OdaPost
---
Oda: They moved the transfer window up. Twice. Nobody at Nacre will say why. #emotion:Worried
===
title: IloFirst
---
Ilo: Anchor Compact survey. You are not in trouble. You are in a chart. #emotion:Amused
Ilo: We are measuring which routes will still hold in a year. Director Venn publishes every figure, including the shelter corridor's capacity. #emotion:Neutral
Ilo: Read that number twice. Then decide whether your household files for a berth. #emotion:Worried
Taren: And the households that do not fit the number? #emotion:Neutral
Ilo: They are in the footnotes. I did not write the footnotes. #emotion:Worried
===
title: IloRepeat
---
Ilo: The notice is posted at every dock. The capacity line is the short one. #emotion:Neutral
===
title: IloPost
---
Ilo: You went toward the Gullet, did you not? Keep your own notes. Ours get revised. #emotion:Determined
===
